        "contenuto_esteso": "To display this content from YouTube, you must enable advertisement tracking and audience measurement. One of your browser extensions seems to be blocking the video player from loading. To watch this content, you may need to disable it on this site. Mixed results for Trump in \"key battleground state\" as primaries continue ahead of midterms Americas Issued on: 17/06/2026 - 11:49 Georgia Republicans delivered a split decision for Donald Trump in runoffs, opting for the president’s preferred U.S. Senate candidate but rejecting his choice for governor - although Trump's endorsement still weighs heavy in ruby-red states. Among Democrats, the primaries hinge on longstanding divides between progressives and moderates as the party tries to chart the best path forward to the midterms. FRANCE 24's Kethevane Gorjestani tells us what to know about the latest primary results. UN chief visits Haiti ahead of new gang suppression force deployment 17/06/2026 Americas #Trump celebrates 80th birthday with #UFC fight at #WhiteHouse 15/06/2026 Americas 12/06/2026 Americas World Cup: Excitement mounts in Mexico City ahead of opening game 11/06/2026 Americas 2026 World Cup: France team arrives on US soil 11/06/2026 Americas Trump immigration stance 'clashes against reality of what is needed to stage a truly global event' 09/06/2026 Americas 2026 World Cup participation conditional to US travel restrictions 09/06/2026 Americas World Cup overshadowed by US travel restrictions and the war in Iran 09/06/2026 Americas Bolivia moves closer to state of emergency among large-scale protests 09/06/2026 Americas"
